a&_nc_ohc=1xOMAbrGgf4Q7kNvwGNpg2T&_nc_oc=Adog7jmLLwY4hcafxvtqmRbqphgrpoueSxKtlhaeOZmh-Q5TA_Tc_rqsyknS9XsjnxM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRR1BXqHe2j22ZX-mS8ozsltn1tskHb3PDMajD7TW9smw&oe=6AE770BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "2533351017175334", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_2533351020508667_348217711739542624_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HoZrojniQEsQ7kNvwGMw2gb&_nc_oc=AdrVSus_EdSbdSiG5qrJ2lk8vEPnwOuqgcvtGXI3LPRKVIQ4VUaN8dwV1OI0AOAVKPE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRswCiCrSr0fl0epYiKzLNvKlPPLhyOBVWUCh4cT5VasQ&oe=6AE762DD"}, "display_name": "Workout Worlds", "keywords": ["fitness", "workout", "boxing"], "long_description": "Workout Worlds brings active VR workouts to a choice of places. Practice punches, duck and lean around obstacles, and keep moving to 12 original tracks.\n\nChoose your setting: a sunny beach, a green park, an indoor gym, a neon arena, or your own room using passthrough.\n\nStart with one of 10 workouts, with Light, Moderate and Intense options across the collection. A tutorial introduces the movements, and workouts include warm-up and cool-down sections. Use Touch controllers or hand tracking, adjust your height and reach, and choose a low-impact option when you prefer it.\n\nReview your workout results and history on your headset. Calorie figures are estimates, not medical measurements.\n\nWorkout Worlds is a single-player experience with no subscription required. Play standing in a clear space with enough room to punch and move safely.", "short_description": "Work out somewhere different. Punch targets, dodge obstacles and move to original music on a sunny beach, in a green park, inside a gym or in a neon arena. You can also bring the workout into your own room with passthrough. Choose from 10 workouts, use controllers or hand tracking, 